{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:35 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"深圳灣過關人龍處處。深圳吃喝玩樂資訊關注組FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccde467b7e4d4362189af3f0cde2a614/2026-10/853087164_10164210127362946_8852997671246475868_2.jpg\"/>\n<p>重陽節連同周末共有3天假期，不少人選擇北上度假，各個口岸都迎來挑戰。有網民在多個社交平台發文，由昨日開始，不少人選擇利用深圳灣口岸過關，口岸大排長龍。</p>\n<img alt=\"深圳灣口岸大排長龍。klmping@threads\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/170e75bd038b67e8857967f139b12944/2026-10/853007363_4611969392416681_4751115992067745262_n-redacted_dot_app.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"深圳吃喝玩樂資訊關注組FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/022e3b70d455d2c376f52d9c62bcf52c/2026-10/853087164_10164210127362946_8852997671246475868_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"深圳吃喝玩樂資訊關注組FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d54e04812696fc7585b55f9a25724be1/2026-10/852948414_10164210127107946_1619449104235459707_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"深圳吃喝玩樂資訊關注組FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/349131cb564faa93b4ca9f8fef738c82/2026-10/851844399_10164210126952946_3305845558068179191_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"深圳吃喝玩樂資訊關注組FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/139a8576d21dcc21fbe85a7ebbfec8f6/2026-10/853628813_10164210126542946_4593175900410764041_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ebabebc8abc61c83162e92251e4f19f/2026-10/854885807_1137559315618259_6262066087589171168_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"mr_ber@Threads \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef7bbb30237210570638c9f2cb9c6048/2026-10/851129309_17989038261118354_7167854930005628675_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巴士站亦排滿過關的人潮。Facebook 圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0badf7b5c53a16ac24cd11d5728d85b/2026-10/855623935_10165629046298706_36674971035577711_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>有網民在社交平台Threads 發帖，指昨日(16日)經深圳灣過關，發現口岸大排長龍，形容是「爆多人過關」，還叫「重陽北上要睇路」；根據帖主的影片，深圳擺了鐵馬，人們根據沿鐵馬排隊，帖主沿路拍攝的10多秒的影片全是過關北上的人潮。</p>\n<p>深圳灣在今早也人龍處處。有網民在FB發文，只見乘過過境的「B車」站排滿等巴士的人龍，也有網民發文，指在內地關人流管制，但只須「15-20分鐘左近右過曬兩邊關」。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T03:59:23.623233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:35:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:56.246261+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:36.153097+00:00","content_hash":"aa3263f7d907190b64afbfd535142a8049a732330a3af841d866e25b18bc1090","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}